  S3: 'Records that stewards once held org-wide read, edit and assign and that the grants were removed. Used for the prohibited-assumption denials STW-DENY-01 and STW-DENY-02.',
  S4: 'Records that a steward note posted from the workbench was saved member-visible. Used for the staff-only default of STW-ACT-08.',
  S5: 'Records the directory policy a steward received after repair. Used for STW-ACT-07 and STW-ACT-08.',
  S6: 'Records that steward triage for unassigned intake had no grant to key off. Used to make triage a separate authority decision (STW-ACT-28 to STW-ACT-31).',
  S7: 'Shows the steward role exists in code. Used only to confirm the persona is real; it defines no action.',
