  ui: `${title} opens with the steward\u2019s own items. An empty list says it is empty, and a failed read says it failed; neither is shown as the other.`,
  deny: ['FAIL_CLOSED_NO_WRITE', 'Without an active organization the steward is redirected and nothing is loaded. A failed read shows an error with retry.'],
